# PvPropal extras
ExtraProductPvPeakPower = PV module peak power (Wc)
ExtraProductPvPeakPowerHelp = Peak power of the photovoltaic module expressed in watt-peak. Visible only for PV modules.
ExtraProposalPvTotalPower = PV total peak power (Wc)
ExtraProposalPvTotalPowerHelp = Sum of (quantity × unit peak power) for all PV products on the proposal.
ExtraProposalPvSalePerWc = Sale price per watt-peak
ExtraProposalPvSalePerWcHelp = Ratio between the proposal total sale price excluding tax and the total PV peak power.
ExtraProposalPvCostPerWc = Cost price per watt-peak
ExtraProposalPvCostPerWcHelp = Ratio between the proposal total cost price excluding tax and the total PV peak power.
ExtraProposalPvMarginRate = Margin rate (%)
ExtraProposalPvMarginRateHelp = Margin expressed as a percentage of the sale price.
ExtraProposalPvMargin = Margin (€)
ExtraProposalPvMarginHelp = Absolute margin in euros = total sale price minus total purchase price.
ExtraProposalPvTargetMargin = Target margin (€)
ExtraProposalPvTargetMarginHelp = Target margin computed from dictionary c_ppv_marge_cible_wc and total PV power.
ExtraProposalPvTargetMarginRate = Target margin rate (%)
ExtraProposalPvTargetMarginRateHelp = Target margin expressed as a percentage of the sale price.
